{"id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","title":"Sigma-Algebra","display":"df-sigma-algebra — Sigma-Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sigma-algebra","aliases":["58-df-sigma-algebra","58-df-zfc-measure7-sigma-algebra"],"display":"df-sigma-algebra — Sigma-Algebra","depends_on":["[[58-df-set]]","[[58-df-powerset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sigma-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sigma-algebra</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-sigma-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma-algebra — Sigma-Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65d9a1e690c32aad\" href=\"?note=65d9a1e690c32aad\" title=\"58-df-set\">58-df-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"58-df-powerset\">58-df-powerset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (universal set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F} \\subseteq \\mathcal{P}(X)\">\\(\\mathcal{F} \\subseteq \\mathcal{P}(X)\\)</span> (collection of subsets)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (generating family candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> (sigma-algebra predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> (standard Euclidean topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7SigmaAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7SigmaAlgebra}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(X\\setminus A\\in\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\;(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A_n\\in\\mathcal F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra} \\vdash \\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land X\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(X\\setminus A\\in\\mathcal F)\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F^\\omega\\;(\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}A_n\\in\\mathcal F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}generated} \\vdash \\sigma_X(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X):\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}generated} \\vdash \\sigma_X(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X):\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\land\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}borel} \\vdash \\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\\coloneqq\\sigma_{\\mathbb R}(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}borel} \\vdash \\mathcal B(\\mathbb R)\\coloneqq\\sigma_{\\mathbb R}(\\tau_{\\mathbb R})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure7} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7SigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}algebra\\text{-}alias\\text{-}measure7} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7SigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\mathcal F,X)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sigma-algebra: closed under complement and countable union</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-measure7-sigma-algebra</code> is merged here.</li>\n<li>Monotone class: closed under countable increasing unions</li>\n<li>Dynkin <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span>-<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span>-system generates <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>-system</li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{P}(X)\">\\(\\mathcal{P}(X)\\)</span> (power set), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R})\">\\(\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{R})\\)</span>, tail sigma-algebra</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Billingsley, Probability and Measure</li>\n<li>Rudin, Real and Complex Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Ass